From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: connect PON NPU ingress to the owner lifecycle

Keep PON defaults on the CPU and admit packets to the NPU only through
verified IFC rules. Close the source scope before restoring those rules,
retain ownership on failure, and monitor the classifier dependencies.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_bank1_routes.h
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_bank1_routes.h
@@ -1,5 +1,49 @@
 #ifndef AIROHA_BANK1_ROUTES_H
 #define AIROHA_BANK1_ROUTES_H
